SUMMARY:Hot dogs (Párek v rohlíku)
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/parek/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/hVLRLxZ5p19p8rrHA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">KOL-K-Küche (outside if the weather is nice)</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Max Kellenberger (<a class="link" href="mailto:max.kellenberger@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">max.kellenberger@cssz.ch</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/8tX5R2m8p5y4pPzC7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Form</a>\n\nDo you also reminisce of the old days when life seemed oh so simple? 😌 When afternoons were filled with exploration and little adventures. One of those childhood adventures might just have been grabbing a hot dog otherwise known as &ldquo;párek v rohlíku&rdquo; and sitting in the sun talking about what cartoon you are going to watch when you get home. If you want to experience a small taste of the past alongside that of a real párek v rohlíku (and Czech beer 🍻, of course), then you are wholeheartedly invited to come to this transformative experience, bring your friends and loved ones, it will be a feast unlike anything UZH has seen before.
